Package: bisrDE
Title: Bulk RNA-Seq Differential Expression Pipeline (BISR)
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person("Mikail", "Bala", , "balami@vcu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(affiliation = "VCU Massey BISR"))
Description: DESeq2-based bulk RNA-seq differential expression pipeline
    for the Bioinformatics Shared Resource at VCU Massey Comprehensive
    Cancer Center. Per-comparison DE, sample-level QC, GO + KEGG +
    Reactome + MSigDB Hallmark enrichment, and a parameterized Quarto
    report. Designed to plug in downstream of nf-core/rnaseq merged-counts
    output.
